OL,3,GNEWSALocal patient watchdogs to stay
OL,4,Aopen after U-turn
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaxine Taffetani, the CEO of
OL,7,FHealthwatch Milton Keynes, said: "There
OL,8,Fwere some happy tears in our office. We
OL,9,Fhad been quietly optimistic but we
OL,10,Fdon't often see these changes made when
OL,11,Fa direction has been set."
